homed.dimsd.editionsd.edition-ofcurrentd.scrollsfile:bb9bdead5386e11575617377328869b6baf2b0d7:0Document A: Hypertext Theses and System Architecture

Thesis 1 (Central Synthesis):
Complex ideas synthesize insights across disparate domains including foundational philosophy, mathematical topology, and optical rendering.

Thesis 2 (Decentralized Identity):
Cryptographic fingerprints and append-only ledgers ensure authorial sovereignty without centralized gatekeepers.
Document B: Supporting Observations and Evidence

Observation Alpha (Philosophy):
Philosophical foundations establish that knowledge cannot be chopped into arbitrary silos.

Observation Beta (Topology):
Zigzag manifolds structure multi-dimensional connections into orthogonal continuous ranks.

Observation Gamma (Optics):
Volumetric 3D ribbons and photonic pulses render hypermedia links tangible in interactive space.
